      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → OpenRouter → OpenRouter settings**.\n2. Paste your notes in **Notes** and type the question in **Question**.\n3. Press **Run**. **Answer** shows the cheap model's answer, or the strong model's when Jev doubts it."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
