      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Quick Answer** uses a fast, inexpensive model. Jev checks in **Supported** that every fact in it comes from the notes, with a threshold of 0.8.\n\n**If/Else Switch** runs only the branch it picks, so **Careful Answer**, a stronger and dearer model, runs only when the quick answer fails the check.\n\nTwo or three paid requests per run. Prices are in **OpenRouter models**; each request's charge is at openrouter.ai/activity."
      ],
      "title": "Using This Workflow"
    },
